Error [jet.StackedRuleLines]: `#FX` is already applied to this type
  --> tests/ui/effects/type_cap_repeated_is_e0999.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | #FX(!IO)
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A cap is one list, so a second `#FX` marker can only repeat or disagree with the first
 Fix: Merge both lists into one `#FX(…)` marker
